# Hub metadata boxes (LOCKED)

Reference: **vBlog aside “On-chain metadata”** and **dApps Metadata** tab boxes.

## Single implementation

- Component: `HubMetadataStatCard` / `HubMetadataStatGrid` in `src/components/hub/HubMetadataStatGrid.tsx`
- Tokens alias only: `TokenStatCard` must wrap `HubMetadataStatCard` (no local chrome)
- Tokens: `src/lib/hub/shellTokens.ts` (`KX_METADATA_STAT_*`, `metadataStatGridClassForCount`)

## Locked look (do not fork)

| Piece | Token / class |
|-------|----------------|
| Surface | `KX_SURFACE_NESTED` |
| Card | `KX_METADATA_STAT_CARD` (`h-full`, hover → `--hub-accent` border) |
| Label | `KX_METADATA_STAT_LABEL` |
| Value | `KX_METADATA_STAT_VALUE` / `_ACCENT` / `_MUTED` / `_LINK` |
| Grid | `metadataStatGridClassForCount(n)`: 1→1, 2/4→2 cols, 3→3, 5+→up to 3. **Never leave an empty third column for 2 items; never full-width leftover for 4.** |
| Stack | `KX_METADATA_STAT_GRID_STACK` (aside On-chain metadata) |
| Tooltips | On the **whole card** via `tooltipTitle` + `tooltipDescription`. **No** inline `?` icons. Never pass height classes (`h-full`) into `Tooltip` `className` (that styles the portal surface). |

## Section titles

Chronicles / Hub standard: **white / zinc-100 titles**, accent only on tilt bar + kickers. Do not paint section titles with `--hub-accent-light`.

## Forbidden

- Local `rounded-* border bg-*` for the same job
- Hardcoded cyan/blue (`#02abb8`, `bg-blue-*`) instead of `--hub-accent*`
- Forcing `lg:grid-cols-3` when only 1–2 boxes exist in a panel
- Full-width span leftovers that create empty panel space
